            "text": "Cross-organization access on briefing routes (read/mark-read/archive other orgs' briefings)\n\nAll four briefing endpoints under /api/business-scopes/:scopeId/briefings filter only by business_scope_id with no organization or scope-membership check. An authenticated user of any organization can read another org's briefing feed (titles, summaries, agent identities) and mutate its state (mark read, archive)."
          },
