          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Missing authentication on avatar generation endpoints (POST /api/avatars/generate, /generate-batch)\n\nPOST /api/avatars/generate and POST /api/avatars/generate-batch lack the `authenticate` preHandler used by sibling avatar routes, so anonymous callers can invoke paid Nova Canvas image generation and write objects to the shared avatars S3 bucket when the feature flag is enabled."
          },
          "locations": [
