            "text": "Cross-user avatar access / missing object-level authorization — Requires further review: GET /api/avatars/presign/:key and GET /api/avatars/* proxy (avatarRoutes.ts)\n\nPresign route requires auth but binds no owner/org check — any authenticated user can presign any key (PoC passed). The /avatars/* proxy is fully unauthenticated and streams any avatars/* key (PoC passed, synthetic marker). Keys are non-enumerable (Date.now + random), impact limited to avatar image reads; also multi-segment keys passed to /presign/ route fall through to the unauthenticated wildcard proxy, bypassing its auth check. Severity is hardening-level (low); not filed as separate report due to turn budget — parent should assess whether to file as low-severity."
